### GET /search.json\
\
Source: https://serpapi.com/things-to-know\
\
Retrieve search results for a given query. This example specifically shows how to get results for 'Coffee' with a mobile device parameter.\
\
```APIDOC\
## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Retrieves search results for a specified query. This example demonstrates fetching results for 'Coffee' using the mobile device parameter.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query.\
- **device** (string) - Optional - Specifies the device to simulate (e.g., "mobile").\
- **api_key** (string) - Required - Your SerpApi API key.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "q": "Coffee",\
  "device": "mobile"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **things_to_know** (object) - Contains various details about the search results, including web results and buttons with nutritional information.\
  - **web_results** (array) - A list of relevant web results.\
  - **buttons** (array) - Interactive buttons with associated data, such as nutritional facts.\
\
#### Response Example\
```json\
\{\
  "things_to_know": \{\
    "web_results": [\
      \{\
        "title": "Price",\
        "snippet": "8 ounces",\
        "link": "https://presto-coffee.com/blogs/coffee/how-much-ground-coffee-to-use-per-cup#:~:text=While%20using%20scoops%20or%20tablespoons,the%20correct%20ratio%20from%20there."\
