## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Retrieves search results for a given query. This example specifically fetches results for 'top sights paris' with mobile device, English language, and US region settings.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query.\
- **device** (string) - Optional - The device to simulate (e.g., 'mobile', 'tablet', 'desktop').\
- **hl** (string) - Optional - The host language of the search results.\
- **gl** (string) - Optional - The Google country to use for the search.\
- **api_key** (string) - Required - Your SerpApi private key.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "q": "top sights paris",\
  "device": "mobile",\
  "hl": "en",\
  "gl": "us"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **short_videos** (array) - A list of short videos related to the search query.\
  - **position** (Integer) - Position of the video.\
  - **title** (String) - Video title.\
  - **source** (String) - Source of the video.\
  - **source_logo** (String) - URL to the source logo.\
  - **date** (String) - Date of the video.\
  - **clip** (String) - URL to a clip of the video.\
  - **duration** (String) - Duration of the video.\
  - **profile_name** (String) - Name of the video creator.\
  - **profile_picture** (String) - URL to the profile picture.\
  - **views** (String) - Views of the video.\
  - **extracted_views** (Integer) - Extracted number from 'views'.\
  - **extensions** (Array) - Other information of the video.\
  - **thumbnail** (String) - URL to the video thumbnail.\
  - **link** (String) - Link to the video.\
\
