```APIDOC\
## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
This endpoint performs a Google search and can return results with specific `missing` and `must_include` fields.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use (e.g., google_light).\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query.\
- **hl** (string) - Optional - The host language of the results.\
- **gl** (string) - Optional - The host country of the results.\
- **missing** (string) - Optional - A term that should be missing from the results.\
- **must_include** (object) - Optional - An object specifying a term that must be included and its associated link.\
  - **word** (string) - The word that must be included.\
  - **link** (string) - The link associated with the `must_include` word.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "engine": "google_light",\
  "q": "Hvordan sammenligne Arne Garborgs Bondestudentar og R\'e5debank",\
  "hl": "en",\
  "gl": "us"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **organic_results** (array) - A list of organic search results.\
  - **position** (integer) - The position of the result on the page.\
  - **title** (string) - The title of the search result.\
  - **link** (string) - The URL of the search result.\
  - **displayed_link** (string) - The displayed URL of the search result.\
  - **snippet** (string) - A snippet of text from the search result.\
  - **date** (string) - The date associated with the result.\
  - **missing** (array) - A list of terms that were missing from the result.\
  - **must_include** (object) - Information about a required term in the result.\
    - **word** (string) - The required word.\
    - **link** (string) - The link associated with the required word.\
\
#### Response Example\
