## GET /search\
\
### Description\
Searches for flights using Google Flights. Supports various parameters including origin, destination, dates, and fare filtering.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
/search\
\
### Parameters\
#### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use (e.g., "google_flights")\
- **hl** (string) - Optional - Language code\
- **gl** (string) - Optional - Country code\
- **departure_id** (string) - Required - Airport code for departure\
- **arrival_id** (string) - Required - Airport code for arrival\
- **outbound_date** (string) - Required - Date of departure\
- **return_date** (string) - Optional - Date of return\
- **travel_class** (integer) - Optional - Class of travel (e.g., 1 for Economy)\
- **currency** (string) - Optional - Currency code\
- **exclude_basic** (boolean) - Optional - If true, excludes basic economy fares\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **search_metadata** (object) - Metadata about the search request\
- **search_parameters** (object) - The parameters used for the search\
- **best_flights** (array) - A list of the best flight options found\
\
#### Response Example\
\{\
  "search_metadata": \{\
    "id": "68d55f17fc8a2b590a866dc5",\
    "status": "Success"\
  \},\
  "search_parameters": \{\
    "engine": "google_flights",\
    "exclude_basic": true\
  \},\
  "best_flights": []\
\}\
