## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Performs a search query and returns JSON results. This example specifically shows how to search for 'Tesla' on a mobile device, with English language and US country settings.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query.\
- **device** (string) - Optional - Specifies the device to simulate (e.g., 'mobile', 'tablet', 'desktop').\
- **hl** (string) - Optional - Specifies the language for the search results (e.g., 'en' for English).\
- **gl** (string) - Optional - Specifies the country for the search results (e.g., 'us' for United States).\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "q": "Tesla",\
  "device": "mobile",\
  "hl": "en",\
  "gl": "us"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **related_categories** (array) - A list of related categories found in the search results. Each category object contains:\
  - **title** (string) - The title of the category.\
  - **thumbnail** (string) - URL to the category thumbnail.\
  - **link** (string) - Direct link to the category.\
  - **serpapi_link** (string) - SerpApi link for the category search.\
