## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Retrieves search results from a specified engine. This example uses the Bing Videos engine to search for 'pizza' on a desktop device.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use (e.g., `bing_videos`).\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query (e.g., `pizza`).\
- **device** (string) - Optional - The device to simulate (e.g., `desktop`).\
- **api_key** (string) - Required - Your SerpApi key.\
\
### Request Example\
```\
https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=bing_videos&q=pizza&device=desktop&api_key=YOUR_API_KEY\
```\
\
