### Description\
This endpoint allows you to search for products on Google Shopping Light and apply specific filters using the `shoprs` parameter. This example demonstrates filtering for 'iphone' with 'On Sale' and 'Black' attributes.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use (e.g., `google_shopping_light`).\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query (e.g., `iphone`).\
- **shoprs** (string) - Required - A complex string encoding the desired filters. For this example, it encodes 'On Sale' and 'Black' filters.\
\
### Request Example\
```\
https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_shopping_light&q=iphone&shoprs=CAESBEoCGAEYBioGaXBob25lMhMIBhIHT24gc2FsZRgCIgRKAhgBWImqIGAC||CAEYASoGaXBob25lMhUIARIFQmxhY2s6CgiFsFEQh7BRMABYiaogYAI\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **shopping_results** (array) - A list of products matching the search query and filters.\
  - **position** (integer) - The position of the product in the search results.\
  - **title** (string) - The title of the product.\
  - **product_link** (string) - The URL to the product page.\
  - **product_id** (string) - The unique identifier for the product.\
  - **immersive_product_page_token** (string) - Token for immersive product page.\
  - **serpapi_immersive_product_api** (string) - SerpApi endpoint for the immersive product page.\
  - **source** (string) - The retailer or source of the product.\
  - **source_icon** (string) - URL of the source's icon.\
  - **price** (string) - The price of the product.\
  - **extracted_price** (float) - The numerical value of the price.\
  - **second_hand_condition** (string, optional) - The condition of the product if it's second-hand.\
  - **rating** (float, optional) - The average customer rating.\
  - **reviews** (integer, optional) - The number of customer reviews.\
  - **snippet** (string, optional) - A short description or snippet about the product.\
  - **thumbnail** (string) - URL of the product thumbnail image.\
  - **serpapi_thumbnail** (string) - SerpApi's processed thumbnail URL.\
  - **tag** (string, optional) - A tag associated with the product (e.g., discount percentage).\
  - **extensions** (array, optional) - Additional information or tags.\
\
#### Response Example\
