### GET /search.json - Google Hotels Search\
\
Source: https://serpapi.com/google-hotels-property-details\
\
This endpoint allows you to search for hotels using various parameters. The example demonstrates a search for 'Bali Resorts' with specific check-in/check-out dates and property token.\
\
```APIDOC\
## GET /search.json - Google Hotels Search\
\
### Description\
This endpoint searches for hotels based on provided query parameters. It's useful for finding hotel availability, pricing, and details.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Parameters\
#### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use, e.g., `google_hotels`.\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query, e.g., `Bali Resorts`.\
- **check_in_date** (string) - Required - The check-in date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format.\
- **check_out_date** (string) - Required - The check-out date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format.\
- **adults** (integer) - Required - The number of adults.\
- **currency** (string) - Optional - The currency for pricing, e.g., `USD`.\
- **gl** (string) - Optional - The Google country domain to use for the search, e.g., `us`.\
- **hl** (string) - Optional - The Google language to use for the search, e.g., `en`.\
- **property_token** (string) - Optional - A unique token for a specific property.\
- **api_key** (string) - Required - Your SerpApi API key.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "engine": "google_hotels",\
  "q": "Bali Resorts",\
  "check_in_date": "2026-04-02",\
  "check_out_date": "2026-04-03",\
  "adults": 2,\
  "currency": "USD",\
  "gl": "us",\
  "hl": "en",\
  "property_token": "ChcI9uq9hrWO2OtjGgsvZy8xMjJ0YzFteBAB",\
  "api_key": "YOUR_API_KEY"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **type** (string) - The type of result, e.g., `hotel`.\
- **name** (string) - The name of the hotel.\
- **description** (string) - A description of the hotel.\
- **link** (string) - A link to the hotel's official website or booking page.\
- **property_token** (string) - The unique token for the property.\
- **address** (string) - The physical address of the hotel.\
- **directions** (string) - A link to Google Maps directions.\
- **phone** (string) - The hotel's phone number.\
- **phone_link** (string) - A tel: link for the phone number.\
- **gps_coordinates** (object) - GPS coordinates of the hotel.\
  - **latitude** (number) - The latitude.\
  - **longitude** (number) - The longitude.\
- **check_in_time** (string) - The standard check-in time.\
- **check_out_time** (string) - The standard check-out time.\
- **rate_per_night** (object) - Pricing information per night.\
  - **lowest** (string) - The lowest rate per night.\
  - **extracted_lowest** (number) - The lowest rate per night as a number.\
  - **before_taxes_fees** (string) - The rate before taxes and fees.\
  - **extracted_before_taxes_fees** (number) - The rate before taxes and fees as a number.\
- **total_rate** (object) - Total pricing information.\
  - **lowest** (string) - The lowest total rate.\
  - **extracted_lowest** (number) - The lowest total rate as a number.\
  - **before_taxes_fees** (string) - The total rate before taxes and fees.\
  - **extracted_before_taxes_fees** (number) - The total rate before taxes and fees as a number.\
- **featured_prices** (array) - An array of featured pricing options from different sources.\
  - **source** (string) - The booking source (e.g., `Priceline`, `Hilton Bali Resort`).\
  - **link** (string) - A link to the booking.\
  - **logo** (string) - The logo of the booking source.\
  - **rooms** (array) - Details about available room types.\
    - **name** (string) - The name of the room.\
    - **link** (string) - A link to book this room.\
    - **num_guests** (integer) - Number of guests the room accommodates.\
    - **rate_per_night** (object) - Pricing for the room per night.\
    - **total_rate** (object) - Total pricing for the room.\
  - **num_guests** (integer) - Number of guests for this featured price.\
  - **rate_per_night** (object) - Pricing per night for this featured price.\
  - **total_rate** (object) - Total pricing for this featured price.\
  - **benefits** (string) - Any benefits associated with booking through this source.\
\
