### GET /search.json - News Search\
\
Source: https://serpapi.com/news-results\
\
This endpoint allows you to search for news articles. The `kgmid` parameter can be used to specify a particular entity, which will override the `q` parameter. For example, using `kgmid: /m/02vqfm` will search for 'Coffee'.\
\
```APIDOC\
## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Searches for news articles. The `kgmid` parameter can be used to specify a particular entity, which will override the `q` parameter. For example, using `kgmid: /m/02vqfm` will search for 'Coffee'.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **q** (string) - Optional - The search query.\
- **tbm** (string) - Required - Set to "nws" for news search.\
- **kgmid** (string) - Optional - The Knowledge Graph ID for a specific entity. Overrides `q`.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "example": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?q=Any+keyword&tbm=nws&kgmid=/m/02vqfm"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **news_results** (array) - A list of news articles found.\
  - **link** (string) - The URL of the news article.\
  - **title** (string) - The title of the news article.\
  - **source** (string) - The source of the news article.\
  - **date** (string) - The relative date of publication (e.g., "7 hours ago").\
  - **published_at** (string) - The absolute date and time of publication in UTC.\
  - **snippet** (string) - A short description or excerpt from the article.\
  - **favicon** (string) - URL of the favicon for the source website.\
  - **thumbnail** (string) - URL of a thumbnail image associated with the article.\
\
#### Response Example\
```json\
\{\
  "search_parameters": \{\
    "engine": "google",\
    "q": "Any keyword",\
    "tbm": "nws",\
    "kgmid": "/m/02vqfm"\
  \},\
  "news_results": [\
    \{\
      "position": 1,\
      "link": "https://www.straitstimes.com/singapore/cheaper-food-and-drinks-at-140-coffee-shops-in-sg60-deal",\
      "title": "Cheaper food and drinks at 140 coffee shops to celebrate SG60",\
      "source": "The Straits Times",\
