### GET /search.json (Google Shopping Light)\
\
Source: https://serpapi.com/google-shopping-light-results\
\
This endpoint allows you to search for products on Google Shopping. You can specify the engine as 'google_shopping_light' and provide a search query 'q'. The results will include product details, pricing, and installment information if available.\
\
```APIDOC\
## GET /search.json\
\
### Description\
Retrieves product search results from Google Shopping with support for installment pricing.\
\
### Method\
GET\
\
### Endpoint\
https://serpapi.com/search.json\
\
### Query Parameters\
- **engine** (string) - Required - The search engine to use, e.g., `google_shopping_light`.\
- **q** (string) - Required - The search query for the product, e.g., `iphone`.\
- **api_key** (string) - Required - Your SerpApi API key.\
\
### Response\
#### Success Response (200)\
- **shopping_results** (array) - A list of products matching the search query.\
  - **position** (integer) - The position of the product in the search results.\
  - **title** (string) - The title of the product.\
  - **product_link** (string) - A direct link to the product page.\
  - **product_id** (string) - The unique identifier for the product.\
  - **price** (string) - The price of the product, potentially including installment information (e.g., "$13.87/mo").\
  - **extracted_price** (float) - The numerical value of the price.\
  - **installment** (object) - Details about installment payments.\
    - **price** (string) - The installment price per period.\
    - **extracted_price** (float) - The numerical value of the installment price.\
    - **period** (integer) - The duration of the installment plan in months.\
  - **rating** (float) - The average user rating for the product.\
  - **reviews** (integer) - The number of user reviews.\
  - **thumbnail** (string) - A URL for the product's thumbnail image.\
\
### Request Example\
```json\
\{\
  "q": "iphone",\
  "engine": "google_shopping_light",\
  "api_key": "YOUR_SERPAPI_KEY"\
\}\
```\
\
### Response Example\
```json\
\{\
  "shopping_results": [\
    \{\
      "position": 1,\
      "title": "Apple iPhone 16 Pro",\
      "product_link": "https://www.google.com/shopping/product/1980258208853190855?gl=us",\
      "product_id": "1980258208853190855",\
      "price": "$13.87/mo",\
      "extracted_price": 13.87,\
      "installment": \{\
        "price": "$13.87/mo",\
        "extracted_price": 13.87,\
        "period": 36\
      \},\
      "rating": 4.6,\
      "reviews": 16000,\
      "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTCp276M6mWNHCNredH2uQhdEq606KxbxxrF6d0zZVO63-UIdJS2FMTMYq9GtBZRLJqVKiQafDb"\
    \}\
  ]\
\}\
```\
